msgstr ""
"Jokoaren grafiko-ezarpenak aldatzen ditu: portaren ezarpen propioak (bereizmena, kalitatea) "
"gainean aplikatzen dira, beraz mod honek kontsolan baino gutxiago egin dezake, itsusiago ikusi "
"edo gaizki ibili"

#. Above every mod install and import.
msgctxt "UI_MOD_RISK"
msgid ""
"Mods are made by other people and are not tested by this project. A mod can crash the game or "
"damage your save: read its page first, keep a copy of your save, and report a mod's problems to "
"its author."
msgstr ""
"Modak beste pertsona batzuek egiten dituzte eta proiektu honek ez ditu probatzen. Mod batek jokoa "
"kraskatu dezake edo zure partida gordea hondatu: irakurri aurretik bere orria, gorde zure "
"partidaren kopia bat eta jakinarazi modaren arazoak bere egileari."

msgctxt "UI_MOD_RISK_ACK"
msgid "I understand"
msgstr "Ulertu dut"

#. Under a mod that changes the game's code (its .ips): the game code is built with it.
msgctxt "UI_MOD_CODE_REBUILD"
msgid "code: turning it on or off builds the game code again before you play (a few minutes)"
msgstr ""
"kodea: aktibatzeak edo desaktibatzeak jokoaren kodea berriro eraikitzen du jokatu aurretik "
"(minutu batzuk)"

#. Under an installed mod that ships shaders (Shader/ files).
msgctxt "UI_MOD_WARN_SHADERS"
msgid ""
"Replaces shaders: the port translates the game's shaders during the setup, so this mod may not "
"show, or may break the picture"
msgstr ""
"Shaderrak ordezkatzen ditu: portak jokoaren shaderrak itzultzen ditu konfigurazioan, beraz mod "
"honek ez da ager daiteke edo irudia hondatu dezake"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE"
msgid "Update to %s (%d MB)"
msgstr "Eguneratu %s bertsiora (%d MB)"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE_FETCHING"
msgid "Downloading %s"
msgstr "%s deskargatzen"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE_FAILED"
msgid "Update failed: %s"
msgstr "Eguneratzeak huts egin du: %s"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATED"
msgid "Updated to %s: setting up again what it changed"
msgstr "%s bertsiora eguneratuta: aldatu dena berriro konfiguratzen"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_NO_GAME_DATA"
msgid "Your own copy of the game · No game data included"
msgstr "Jokoaren zure kopia propioa · Ez dago jokoaren daturik"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_KNOWN"
msgid ""
"The last game stopped with a known problem, followed in issue #%d. No need to report it again."
msgstr ""
"Azken partida arazo ezagun batengatik gelditu zen, #%d gertakarian jarraitzen dena. Ez da berriro "
"jakinarazi behar."

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_FIXED"
msgid "The last game stopped with a problem that %s fixes. Update to get the fix."
msgstr ""
"Azken partida %s bertsioak konpontzen duen arazo batengatik gelditu zen. Eguneratu konponketa "
"izateko."

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_CRASH"
msgid ""
"The last game stopped with an error. Reporting it with logs/mkw.log attached helps to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Azken partida errore batengatik gelditu zen. logs/mkw.log erantsita jakinarazteak konpontzen "
"laguntzen du."

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_OPEN"
msgid "Open issue #%d"
msgstr "Ireki #%d gertakaria"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_REPORT"
msgid "Report it"
msgstr "Jakinarazi"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_LASTRUN_DISMISS"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Itxi"

msgctxt "UI_MENU_UPDATE_CHECK"
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Bilatu eguneraketak"

msgctxt "UI_MENU_UPDATE_CHECK_DESC"
msgid ""
"At start, ask GitHub for a newer release of the port and offer it on the start screen (a few "
"seconds at most, nothing offline)."
msgstr ""
"Abiaraztean, GitHub-i portuaren bertsio berriago bat galdetzen dio eta hasierako pantailan "
"eskaintzen du (segundo gutxi batzuk gehienez, ezer ez lineaz kanpo)."

